.TH HOMELAB-DOCTOR 1 "July 2026" "Homelab Doctor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
homelab-doctor \- read-only Linux diagnostics for self-hosters
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-doctor
.B check
[
.B --profile docker|storage|networking
] [
.B --format terminal|json|markdown
] [
.B --dry-run
]
.br
.B homelab-doctor bundle --output FILE [--privacy standard|private-ips] [--dry-run]
.br
.B homelab-doctor explain CHECK_ID
.br
.B homelab-doctor list-checks
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs non-mutating diagnostics. No cleanup, restart, permission change, firewall modification, cloud upload, or public-IP lookup is performed. Permission-limited checks are reported as skipped.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on successful command completion; 2 for invalid arguments or bundle-write errors.
